# DeepSeek's plan usage, in its usage panel.

## Setup: how to find each value the provider reads. Setting names,
## environment variables, URLs, cookie and header names, and the
## service's own menu paths stay as written.

usage-deepseek-setting-api-key = 从 https://platform.deepseek.com/api_keys 获取的 DeepSeek API 密钥。用于读取剩余额度。
usage-deepseek-setting-platform-token = 未设置 API 密钥时使用。登录 https://platform.deepseek.com，打开开发者工具 > Application > Local Storage > https://platform.deepseek.com，复制 userToken 条目的值（整个 JSON 值或仅其 "value" 字段均可）。

## The report: the credit balance in the currency it is funded in, split
## into paid and granted credit.

usage-deepseek-balance = 余额
usage-deepseek-credits = 额度
# Credit the account bought.
usage-deepseek-paid = 充值
# Credit DeepSeek gave, such as a sign-up bonus.
usage-deepseek-granted = 赠送
usage-deepseek-status = 状态
usage-deepseek-add-credits = 在 platform.deepseek.com 充值
usage-deepseek-unavailable = 余额不可用于 API 调用
